2026-10-13T10:12:42.3313444Z   -b BLOCK_NUMBER, --block-number BLOCK_NUMBER
2026-10-13T10:12:42.3313781Z                         block number: total number of blocks.
2026-10-13T10:12:42.3314161Z   -d DUMP_EPOCH_NUMBER, --dump-epoch-number DUMP_EPOCH_NUMBER
2026-10-13T10:12:42.3314539Z                         dump epoch number: number of dump epochs.
