2026-10-13T10:12:42.3315288Z                         load epoch number: number of load epochs.
2026-10-13T10:12:42.3315654Z   -o STORAGE_BACKEND, --storage-backend STORAGE_BACKEND
2026-10-13T10:12:42.3316037Z                         storage backend: storage backend path; may be
2026-10-13T10:12:42.3316366Z                         repeated.
2026-10-13T10:12:42.3316707Z   --model MODEL         model directory (or config.json) for model-driven
2026-10-13T10:12:42.3317142Z                         mode. When set, shard-size/shard-number/block-number
2026-10-13T10:12:42.3317558Z                         are computed from the model config and override any
2026-10-13T10:12:42.3318124Z                         manually provided values.
2026-10-13T10:12:42.3318501Z   --tp TP               tensor parallel size; divides num_kv_heads per rank
